title: "@three-ws/kol-mcp"
abstract: "Track one smart trader from any AI agent — a tracked KOL wallet's portfolio P&L (realized/unrealized, win rate, top holding) and its trades on a given mint. Read-only over the live public three.ws KOL API. No key, no signer, no payment."
